{"version":1,"content":"<p>高級警員朱振國2005年獨自巡邏期間截查一名青年時遭割頸，失血過多，成植物人臥牀21年，上月16日離世，終年52歲。</p><p>警務處今日（23日）為朱振國舉行警隊最高榮譽喪禮，其遺體安葬於浩園。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.565541+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:16:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T09:38:18.069603+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:38:06.565541+00:00","content_hash":"959973a96375d3a42247ee5c0f086d55fa23f41b9ad06055761048d9eadbc0cb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}